---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Disney Lorcana · UndrwrldCub">
<header style="position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(14,12,18,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px">
    <a href="/" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#F6F1FA;font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;white-space:nowrap">
      <img src="/brand/octopus-192.png" alt="" style="width:40px;height:40px;object-fit:contain"><span>UndrwrldCub</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/#realms" style="margin-left:auto;font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:#A69DB4;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px"class="nav-link">← All realms</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section style="border-bottom:1px solid #2D2838;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(197,139,224,.12),#0E0C12 90%)">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 32px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <div style="width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:14px;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:26px;color:#C58BE0;background:rgba(197,139,224,.16);border:1px solid rgba(197,139,224,.4)">L</div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0">
      <div style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#C58BE0">Collection</div>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Cinzel',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,46px);line-height:1.2;margin:4px 0 8px;color:#F6F1FA">Disney Lorcana</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;color:#A69DB4;max-width:72ch;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">The newest shelf in the lair. Ink is still drying on this one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<main style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px">
  <section style="margin-top:44px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:16px">
    <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:20px">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#F6F1FA">What it is</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;color:#A69DB4;font-size:15px">Ravensburger's trading card game built on Disney characters reimagined as glimmers. Six inks, lore to quest for, and a very pretty card frame.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:20px">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#F6F1FA">Where we are</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;color:#A69DB4;font-size:15px">Cataloguing. The Lorcana project is in its first pass: sorting what we own by set and ink before any tracking or deck notes go up.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-radius:12px;padding:20px">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#F6F1FA">What comes next</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;color:#A69DB4;font-size:15px">The same treatment Riftbound gets: a tracked collection with value snapshots, plus a place to keep deck lists between sets.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top:52px;background:#18151F;border:1px solid #2D2838;border-left:3px solid #C58BE0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px">
    <strong style="color:#F6F1FA">Work in progress.</strong> <span style="color:#A69DB4">Check back once the first set is sorted. In the meantime, the <a href="/riftbound/">Riftbound binder</a> shows what this page will grow into.</span>
  </section>
</main>

<footer style="margin-top:72px;border-top:1px solid #2D2838;background:#13111A">
  <div style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px 40px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:#A69DB4">
    <img src="/brand/octopus-192.png" alt="" style="width:56px;height:56px;object-fit:contain">
    <div style="flex:1 1 320px">© 2026 UndrwrldCub. Disney Lorcana is a trademark of Disney and Ravensburger. This page is unofficial fan content.</div>
    <a href="/" style="font-family:'Barlow Semi Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:600">undrwrldcub.com</a>
  </div>
</footer>
</Base>
